se, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/26", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 938510, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/98b38df7/uploads/origins/1be08c92-2e96-47e9-85ab-8acb03a3adb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f4c31b6b888a8e588288be77c170641", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/98b38df7/uploads/origins/1be08c92-2e96-47e9-85ab-8acb03a3adb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=32b123fa4816ea37b09b88f42e31499f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！この2人のキャラクターのアートをお願いします。\n\nキャラクター1\nソニックOVAのサラ姫！ナックルズチャオティックスの敵、ガットバスターのぬいぐるみを抱いてほしいです。サラがピースサインをして、見ている人に微笑みかけてほしいです。\n\nキャラクター2\nキング・オブ・ファイターズのエンジェル。キュートさとセクシーさをミックスしたようなポーズで、見る人に微笑みかけてほしい。あと、カオスコーラの缶を飲んだり、持ったり、ソニックの指輪を指にはめたり。あなた次第です！\n\nあなたのダイナミックなアングルやポーズがとても好きなので、自由に調整してください。ただ、もし可能であれば、キャラクターごとに画像を分けてほしいです。ご面倒であれば、合体のみでも構いません。よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14D118GbdN-AFh4SdQaeuNims8QHoTx0B?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/630975ed/uploads/origins/749a50ef-1844-4956-8ef2-99db9d4db77e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7089bf6bcdb65d271782bace8768e90", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/630975ed/uploads/origins/749a50ef-1844-4956-8ef2-99db9d4db77e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e34907577a44b849a38a4ff3b13abddf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello secretter , I really like the previous work, I want to request again. If something is difficult, feel free to cancel it or resend the amount. \n\nPlease draw 2017x the hedgehog again. This time draw 2017x with my human OC. ( she is the human version of the rabbit OC you drew before )\n\nThe theme is the Sonic The Hedgehog video game from 2006.\n\nAs I mentioned before, 2017x likes to imitate Sonic. 2017x will play the role of Sonic , and my OC ( anime style girl ) will play the role of Princess Elise. I've given her an outfit based on the Princess. Height difference is the same as Sonic and Princess Elise.\n\nPose is like the pictures from the game I sent. 2017x is carrying the girl OC in his arms and running. Princess carry style ( お姫様抱っこ ). I'll be happy if it's fullbody composition. \n\nThe 2017x looks confident. The girl OC will be happy, with a gentle smile.\n\nPlease make a background like the forest in the game. If you want to see the game scene : \n\nhttps://youtu.be/ZC30HrWntWU?si=vOt4H3MD8BlrKtX7\n\nThe scene starts in dark part of the forest. Please watch the video for a few seconds to see the scene of the forest with sunlight. I would like that scene for the background, beautiful forest with sunlight, with white flower petals falling. In the first part of the video, you can see the pose of running and carrying the girl in his hands !\n\n2017x detail : Seprated eyes. Wide smile with teeth. No gloves or shoes, it's part of his body.\n\nOC details : 21 years old. Black hair, grey gradient. The tips of her hair are white. ( 3 colour gradient  ). In the section where the hair is tied, there is a white streak design. Pale purple eyes. Diamond necklace around her neck. Silver cross emblem badge. Silver chain. Please make her happy and smile softly.\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/21k6j48ts1l1", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 3599982, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7204370f/uploads/origins/9793df16-0aba-466c-8601-edcef999e22f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ff8a79ee86e13219079615e245c5531", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7204370f/uploads/origins/9793df16-0aba-466c-8601-edcef999e22f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f85fbc5cec5d1328cf1da6bfcef93f32", "src_set": ""}, "body": "以前はありがとうございました！今回は私のOCであるヤギのバフのアートを依頼したいと思います。ポーズなどはお任せします。\n\nヤギのバフ 参考：https://imgur.com/a/cqehluO", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 3599982, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd0df783/uploads/origins/f229a9c7-cbe4-4e29-b3fb-a0a3b997233d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f417467ddfebf4080e5cd556282ba813", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd0df783/uploads/origins/f229a9c7-cbe4-4e29-b3fb-a0a3b997233d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bff5e507fa2e169da536d11e56ad71ba", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ゲーム「ソニック・ザ・ファイターズ」のキャラクター、猫のハニーのアートが欲しいです。かわいければなんでもうれしいです。\n\nハニー・ザ・キャット参考：https://imgur.com/a/AxZRnph", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 3455204, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/57c82b77/uploads/origins/6fbd1e70-7eca-4b0f-a0a7-669d53385637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5029288e2c3cebbfedf49f5b7e6d53e6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/57c82b77/uploads/origins/6fbd1e70-7eca-4b0f-a0a7-669d53385637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fcbe4fc3f61a2ff52b91930bab047540", "src_set": ""}, "body": "しくれさん、初めまして!\n初めてイラストリクエストを出します。\n今回は…僕が推しのソニックキャラのベクター・ザ・クロコダイルがヒーローになった姿を描いてほしいです。\n今回、ベクターが着ているヒーローの服装は…\n明るい銀色のヒーローマスク、明るい銀色のヒーロースーツ、明るい銀色のヒーローブーツ、明るい銀色のヒーロー変身ベルト、明るい銀色のヒーローマントを着用しています。\n背景やポーズなどは…しくれさんにおまかせでお願いします。\n僕のわがままなイラストリクエストですが、お願いします!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 2021535, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/949c63b6/uploads/origins/8a5198ed-0895-4d1a-af82-6310435f2fee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f5158a6ed0605c3a45fdb89bcee0275", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/949c63b6/uploads/origins/8a5198ed-0895-4d1a-af82-6310435f2fee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f6f5b36425cb4cd636d15df34ae926c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのソニックスタイルのアートが大好きです。私のソニックのOCとシャドウ・ザ・ヘッジホッグのアートワークをお願いしたいです！\nシャドウが座っていて、私のキャラクターが膝の上に座っているような感じでお願いします。\nシャドーは真面目でクールな感じだけど、僕のキャラクターが好きな感じにしてほしい！にやにやしているような表情でも、あなたが彼に似合うと思う表情でも、どちらでもいいです。\n私のキャラクターは、シャイで甘えん坊で優しい天使の子猫です。彼女の包帯と金色のイヤリングに注意してください。\n赤面したり、シャドウの膝の上で緊張して喜んだり。シャドウのことが大好き♡ クールだけどラブラブな感じがいいですね。あとの構図はお任せします!\nよろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XlhBN39-W6Dn4iifBrfPpQ2aEwAz6gwJ", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82bf6d52/uploads/origins/a1704ffe-11fb-4298-b5b1-ca7fcb46c67d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5c38be4c8a08e3761b3e69e74d403eda", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 3416679, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f03b9015/uploads/origins/8316883a-6859-44b5-9859-2e56838ece84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e91aee74d3e27866a3b36dc5aa19eef1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f03b9015/uploads/origins/8316883a-6859-44b5-9859-2e56838ece84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44228a2c5754b6556c951284a6eeb0c8", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello ! I really like your Sonic art, please draw 2 characters together for me.\n\n2017x : An entity who likes to imitate Sonic , he believes he is Sonic. Personality and behaviour are similar to Sonic. He likes to trick people to think he is the real Sonic. However, he has a strange appearance. Separated eyes. Teeth. Longer spikes than Sonic. He does not have gloves and shoes, those are part of his body. For his expression, I want him to look at the second character, Omen.\n\nOmen : Harlequin Rabbit. Please see the references for her hairstyle and tail. Do not forget the tail if she's drawn in sideview. For Omen's expression, she's surprised and she looks at 2017x.\n\nFor the pose, I'd like if they could hold hands and run together. I sent a picture of Sonic and Tails running and holding hands, it would be cute if it's something like that. Feel free to interpret the idea, I'd like a lighthearted and cute atmosphere. Also , there's a height difference if possible. \n\nI'll be very happy if you'll consider it. Thank you.\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/22qdsnmx9z3", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a7fbc07/uploads/origins/c49963d2-f721-4e69-9bc2-66dd82565e75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb3d7f8525870300ebb3e8b420a72f0a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a7fbc07/uploads/origins/c49963d2-f721-4e69-9bc2-66dd82565e75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65d31f9d3ba1339de099e8bbfaf84545", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n 私のOC、ディジーとベクター・ザ・クロコダイルを描いてほしい。\n\nこの二人は付き合っています。身長差が半端ないんです！  \n\nベクターは180cm\n\nディジーは120cm\n\nベクターはディジーを腕に抱き、できれば顔の近くでも抱くこと！  \n\n以上、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/cqdd2qjt6m3dpr8e6htsd/AOMW3nMfTUH7hET2F15C9jI?rlkey=no3s9b4w4i70w63fus4dh9lv7&st=60c0j7rf&dl=0", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image