sing and facing the viewer while leaning back against his motorcycle. I'd also like to ask a Kuromi ornament hanging off his handlebar if you can.\n\nI'd like to ask something similar to this art piece by Tracy Yardley: https://files.catbox.moe/m17ju6.jpg\nYou can keep Shadow the hedgehog without an outfit. But if you have something in mind then please, feel free!\n\nif possible can you provide a project file with the background blank so I can reorient the image needed to use as a wallpaper for mobile and desktop?\n\nThank you!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 3486722, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3f743bb/uploads/origins/2a9bbf56-d924-4351-bd3a-1bc30240f318?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5ca5a85cdb156b93a9d26a761d2da2b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3f743bb/uploads/origins/2a9bbf56-d924-4351-bd3a-1bc30240f318?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eaa0e1c32be9985149fb45c385cd73d7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのページのアートを見ていて、とても良いと思ったので、ネオマ・スターのアートを作ることに興味があるのですが。\n\n彼女がどのようにポーズをとっているか、どのように見えるかなどの詳細はお任せしても構わないのですが、キャラクターの背景を少し説明すると、彼女はパンツではなくオーバーサイズのシャツや服を好んで着るエイリアンです。\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/3sgSqZX.png", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 2795184, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6f906e0/uploads/origins/29a44c38-056b-4d17-8945-a8c107bddedb?bg=%23fff&auto=format