ng. In the game, there is a power attack where the player must squat and hold it for a long time to defeat their opponent. I wanted to ask if you can draw my OC squatting as well, with the foot behind her drawn in a blue aura.\n\nHere is the link to that fight: https://youtu.be/uYtQypumhQg?t=774\nHere is a pose reference: https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f896f8c71916332ac5802c3529c6e4b/351ab6773c827919-7e/s1280x1920/cddf7b51a8cfb75fac97763c46814f565b8e94b0.gifv", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b377d8a9/uploads/origins/cd55e0a2-655f-499e-8015-9f01023dac7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aec31fb6c1d436ebead778e70f8af8d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b377d8a9/uploads/origins/cd55e0a2-655f-499e-8015-9f01023dac7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c76420845f9422818fca0760d514107d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの新作を偶然見て、とても良い絵だと思いました。突然ですが、セーラームーンの怪獣ペロペロを描いていただけませんか？特に何も考えていなくて、ただかわいいとかかっこいいとかでいいんです。お腹の顔は省いていただいて結構です。\n\n描きたくないなら、キャンセルしてくれて構わないよ。いずれにせよ、これからも頑張って描いてください！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Q5gaCRE", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Secretter_ZGwl/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3408633, "client_id": 2221801, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/335e83db/uploads/origins/106abd96-f971-4590-bfbc-411287abc835?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3267a42e05a967ab359fa4fca8111267"